  {
    "id": "2039697500559307211",
    "authorName": "Bookpast",
    "authorHandle": "@bookpast",
    "platform": "twitter",
    "content": "RT @themeatly: Hi, Bendy fans! I really hope you all enjoyed our April Fool's Day video this year. :) I had a blast making it, and reuniting some important horror faces. Thanks so much to the incredible creators whose characters have been so iconic and mean so much to all of us. Now that the fun of April Fool's Day is over, I personally wanted to talk about the upcoming 414 day. We've been working every day on \"Bendy: The Cage\" and several other major projects, and we wanted to have some cool things to show for 414. But we realized the deadline was putting major pressure on the team, and was taking away from time we want to spend just making the games/projects good. So 414 will be a very minimal event this year. There's no major news coming at this time. Just some small goodies. :) We love what we do and care about it deeply. We don't want to release underbaked or false promises. We actually want to respect our players and fans. Hype is fun.. but actual substance is what makes the things we love worthwhile. That said, there is plenty of Bendy stuff coming!.. big and small. TONS, actually! It just isn't ready yet. When it does, you'll be nicely overwhelmed with how much will hit you. :) Thanks to everyone! Thank you for being a Bendy fan! -theMeatly",
    "timestamp": "2026-04-02T13:32:34Z",
